iN", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "An उपपद of attendant word तत्रोपपदं सप्तमीस्थम्‌ ३.१.९२ which does not end with a tense-affix ३.४.७८ is invariably compounded with that with which it is in construction. The compound thus formed is तत्-पुरुष।\n\nTerms: समास-तत्-पुरुष-उपसर्ग-अव्यय", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उपपदमतिङ् २.२.१९", "२.२.१९", "२.२.१९ उपपदमतिङ्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["upapadamatiN २.२.१९", "२.२.१९", "२.२.१९ upapadamatiN"]}], "upasarjanan purvam‌": [{"id": "upasarjanaM pUrvam‌", "headword": "उपसर्जनं पूर्वम्‌", "headword_slp1": "upasarjanaM pUrvam‌", "fold": "upasarjanan purvam‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The उपसर्जन १.२.४३ is to be placed first in a compound.\n\nTerms: समास-द्वन्द्व-definition", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उपसर्जनं पूर्वम्‌ २.२.३०", "२.२.३०", "२.२.३० उपसर्जनं पूर्वम्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["upasarjanaM pUrvam‌ २.२.३०", "२.२.३०", "२.२.३० upasarjanaM pUrvam‌"]}], "upajYopakraman tadadyaciKyasayam‌": [{"id": "upajYopakramaM tadAdyAciKyAsAyAm‌", "headword": "उपज्ञोपक्रमं तदाद्याचिख्यासायाम्‌", "headword_slp1": "upajYopakramaM tadAdyAciKyAsAyAm‌", "fold": "upajYopakraman tadadyaciKyasayam‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "A तत्-पुरुष compound ending with the words उपज्ञा 'invention' and उपक्रम 'commencement' is neuter in gender, when it is intended to express the starting point of a work which is first invented or commenced.\n\nTerms: समास-तत्-पुरुष", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उपज्ञोपक्रमं तदाद्याचिख्यासायाम्‌ २.४.२१", "२.४.२१", "२.४.२१ उपज्ञोपक्रमं तदाद्याचिख्यासायाम्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["upajYopakramaM tadAdyAciKyAsAyAm‌ २.४.२१", "२.४.२१", "२.४.२१ upajYopakramaM tadAdyAciKyAsAyAm‌"]}], "upakadiByonyatarasyamadvandve": [{"id": "upakAdiByo'nyatarasyAmadvaMdve", "headword": "उपकादिभ्योऽन्यतरस्यामद्वंद्वे", "headword_slp1": "upakAdiByo'nyatarasyAmadva